Package: pnspop
Type: Package
Title: Population Size Estimation from Privatized Network Sampling (PNS) or Respondent Driven Sampling (RDS) Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Ian E.", "Fellows", email = "ian@fellstat.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package utilizes the methods of Khan et. al. One-step Estimation of Networked Population Size: Respondent-Driven Capture-Recapture with Anonymity (2017) to estimate population size from RDS or PNS data.
